  "summary": "codemonkey is a scriptable coding-agent CLI written in Python 3.11, built with Typer, Rich, and httpx, designed to work with OpenAI-style and Anthropic-style endpoints while defaulting to a local llama.cpp server. It provides exec/review/sessions capabilities under autonomous construction."
